      "result": "Implemented the Rails 8.0.2 URL shortener with PostgreSQL persistence, unique custom and generated codes, click tracking, validation, and the requested JSON endpoints.\n\n`sh start.sh` applies pending migrations and starts the server in the foreground on `0.0.0.0:8000`. I verified creation, duplicate-code conflicts, generated codes, malformed and invalid requests, lookups, redirects and click increments, 404s, and that data remained after restarting the server. `bundle exec rails zeitwerk:check` also passed.\n\nThe test server has been stopped; the API is ready to start with `sh start.sh`.",
